<title>UK: Europe cotton is very dull, holidays.</title>
<headline>Europe cotton is very dull, holidays.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asking prices were in a tight band and  activity was confined to just a few tentative inquiries for forward  shipment of Central Asian styles in a European raw cotton market that  was very dull, subdued by spinning mills' holidays.</p>
</text>
